   416|        <div class="handwritten-box">
   417|            In the classical texts, Ren Water seated on Chen Earth (your Day Pillar) is called "The River Meets the Reservoir." You have depth, but you also have containment. This means that when you find the right environment — the right team, the right city, the right partner — you can accumulate tremendous power. But in the wrong environment, you feel dammed up, restless, and out of place.
