   441|            You are now in the <span class="red-ink">Gui Chou</span> Luck Pillar (ages 36–45). This is a Water-Earth cycle — a time of <span class="emphasis">consolidation, deep learning, and quiet accumulation.</span>
   442|        </p>
   443|        <p>
   444|            This is not a decade for reckless expansion. It is a season to sharpen your skills, clarify your reputation, and build assets that will mature in the next cycle. The seeds you plant now — a book, a course, a consulting practice, a portfolio — will bear fruit between ages 46 and 55.
   445|        </p>
